graph LR
    KR["kuberay-operator"]

    %% External libraries / runtime
    KR -->|framework, webhook + metrics servers| CR["controller-runtime v0.24.1"]
    KR -->|API client| CG["client-go v0.36.0"]
    KR -->|Route, APIServer TLS types| OAPI["openshift/api"]
    KR -->|Gateway, HTTPRoute, ReferenceGrant| GWAPI["gateway-api v1.4.1"]
    KR -->|Issuer/Certificate types| CMLIB["cert-manager v1.19.4 API"]
    KR -->|metrics| PROMLIB["prometheus client_golang v1.23.2"]
    KR -.->|optional gang scheduling| Volcano["volcano.sh/apis v1.13.0"]
    KR -.->|optional coscheduling| SP["scheduler-plugins v0.33.5"]
    KR -.->|RayCronJob, gate off| Cron["robfig/cron v3.0.1"]

    %% Cluster services
    KR -->|REST + watch 6443/TCP HTTPS| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server"]
    KR -->|webhook cert + Ray mTLS PKI| CertMgr["cert-manager (cluster)"]
    KR -->|metrics serving cert| SvcCA["OpenShift service-ca"]
    KR -->|TLS profile read/watch| OCPCfg["OpenShift APIServer / KubeAPIServer config"]
    KR -.->|legacy Route, disabled on OpenShift| Routes["OpenShift Routes"]

    %% Internal platform
    RHODS["rhods-operator / opendatahub-operator"] -->|deploys config/openshift<br/>params.env| KR
    KR -->|HTTPRoute parentRef| DSG["data-science-gateway<br/>(openshift-ingress)"]
    DSG -.->|end-user auth, outside repo| GWAuth["Platform Gateway auth<br/>(kube-auth-proxy / EnvoyFilter)"]
    Kueue["Kueue"] -.->|suspend / managedBy| KR
    CodeFlare["CodeFlare SDK / Workbenches"] -->|create RayCluster / RayJob| KR
    Prom["Prometheus / OpenShift monitoring"] -->|scrape 8443/TCP HTTPS| KR

    %% Operands
    KR -->|job submit / Serve status 8265/TCP HTTP| RayHead["Ray head dashboard"]
    KR -->|health 8000/TCP HTTP| RayServe["Ray Serve proxy"]
    KR -->|injects sidecar| KRP["kube-rbac-proxy image"]
    KR -->|operand images| RayImg["Ray runtime images (user-specified)"]

